{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日から３月ですね。\n卒業生の皆さん、\nご卒業おめでとうございます！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も高校卒業からもう２年経ちます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"月日が経つのが早いって\n毎年思っていましたが\n最近やけに早く感じる..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間を有意義に過ごすのが目標でもあります☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間を大切に！ということで\n生写真撮影の待ち時間に、\n真夏と変なメガネかけて遊んでいました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(真夏写真集発売おめでとう☺︎)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/01/7430016/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は外国人服な赤メガネ金髪眉毛付け鼻で\n真夏は古典的な勤勉メガネ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/01/7430016/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服がお洒落だからこそ\n違和感が半端無い！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うちらやばくない⁉︎\n写真撮ると余計やばいねΣ(-᷅_-᷄๑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう会話をしてました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/01/7430016/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちなみに伊織も真夏と同じメガネを\nかけて遊んでました笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さすが真夏軍団！！\n考える事が同じみたい(OvO)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"賑やかで楽しいメンバーと\n一緒にいられて嬉しいな〜☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"------------------------------------------------♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♬ ChihaMusic"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「イチブトゼンブ」B'zさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この曲ずっと聞いてたな〜\nそしてドラマの主題歌だったから\n見ながら歌ってた。\nドラマ含め大好きな曲！\nじっくり聞いて歌ってみると\nなんてキーの高い...\n凄い。そしてかっこいい。\n\"愛しぬけるポイントがひとつありゃいいのに\nそれだけでいいのに\"\nこの歌詞が好き。\n一途な感じと少し感じる切なさ。\nやっぱりいいな〜☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/chiharu.saito/img/blog/chiharu.saito/img/2017/03/01/7430016/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪というか横の毛？を\nくるんっとしすぎちゃった。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"綺麗な弧を描いてる笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伸ばしかけの前髪とか\n長さが中途半端な髪の毛の\n扱い方って本当に難しい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このもどかしさに、ん\"〜(-｡-;ってなる。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斎藤ちはる"}],"source":"archive"}